        "description": "<p>Set a custom redirect after WooCommerce checkout. You can use either a direct URL or a WordPress page ID. Plain and simple.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plug-in files to the &#092;\\&#8217;/wp-content/plugins/&#092;\\&#8217; folder, or install from the WordPress plugin library.</li>\n<li>Activate the plug-in from the WordPress plug-in menu.</li>\n<li>Change the settings in the WordPress menu.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='q%3A%20how%20does%20this%20plug-in%20work%3F'>\nQ: How does this plug-in work?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>A: It just adds a simple code to the function.php file.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
